      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine",
        "void"
      ],
      "text": "When the herexen is destroyed, it explodes in a wave of void energy with the effects of a 3-action, 4th-rank Harm spell (DC 26 basic Fortitude save).\n\nThe herexen is destroyed, so it doesn't gain any Hit Points from this use of harm, and it doesn't need to have any harm spells remaining to use this ability."
